1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,410
You learned your mother tongue without a subscription.

2
00:00:04,410 --> 00:00:08,000
Why should your next language be locked behind one?

3
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:17,850
1.4 billion people are learning, or want to learn, English.

4
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:22,730
40% of people worldwide lack education in a language they

5
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:24,440
understand fluently.

6
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:29,240
And 430 million people need rehabilitation for disabling

7
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,350
hearing loss.

8
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:37,950
Speakara brings structured language learning, interactive

9
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:42,000
practice and real-world speaking into one experience.

10
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,040
Bite-sized lessons, stories, quests and streaks, with

11
00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:47,650
Kiko cheering you on.

12
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,250
Meet your personal AI language companion.

13
00:00:54,250 --> 00:00:58,850
Powered by Google Gemini and brought to life through Anam,

14
00:00:58,850 --> 00:01:01,940
it's always ready to practise with you.

15
00:01:01,940 --> 00:01:02,810
It listens.

16
00:01:02,810 --> 00:01:06,220
It speaks, in the language you're learning.

17
00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:11,130
And you can interrupt any time, just like a real conversation.

18
00:01:11,130 --> 00:01:15,570
Explore real-life scenarios, learn through roleplay, and

19
00:01:15,570 --> 00:01:18,580
build confidence by actually speaking.

20
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:25,830
But learning shouldn't stop with AI.

21
00:01:25,830 --> 00:01:29,850
Speakara's language exchange connects you with real

22
00:01:29,850 --> 00:01:34,330
learners around the world through one-to-one video calls.

23
00:01:34,330 --> 00:01:38,580
Match by language and level, start a conversation, and

24
00:01:38,580 --> 00:01:39,760
learn together.

25
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:41,960
You help with your language.

26
00:01:41,960 --> 00:01:43,700
They help with theirs.

27
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:51,370
And language should be accessible to everyone.

28
00:01:51,370 --> 00:01:55,400
Our next phase aims to bring language education to Deaf

29
00:01:55,400 --> 00:01:59,650
learners, through an Indian Sign Language teaching avatar,

30
00:01:59,650 --> 00:02:03,460
developed with the Deaf community and ISL educators.

31
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,090
Our approach is simple.

32
00:02:09,090 --> 00:02:14,090
Free forever for learners in India, and just $1 a month

33
00:02:14,090 --> 00:02:16,720
for learners everywhere else.

34
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:20,540
Imagine 100,000 international subscribers:

35
00:02:20,540 --> 00:02:24,270
that's $100,000 in monthly gross revenue.

36
00:02:24,270 --> 00:02:27,720
At 1 million, it's $1 million a month.

37
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:32,810
Speakara.

38
00:02:32,810 --> 00:02:37,470
A world where everyone can learn, speak and connect,

39
00:02:37,470 --> 00:02:38,990
without barriers.
